+++ b/docs/releases/beta.md
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+# Exact retained compatibility
+
+An exact code-210 request in the beta profile keeps the previously retained
+Birch line, even though ordinary new selections avoid that retained release.
+
+This behavior keeps pinned consumers on the API they already compiled against.
